388
00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:52.302
{\an8}Nasa punerarya noon ang kabaong,
kaya dapat nandoon ang pumatay

389
00:16:52.386 --> 00:16:53.804
{\an8}sa tinatayang oras ng kamatayan.

390
00:16:54.471 --> 00:16:55.889
{\an8}MORTUARY

391
00:16:55.973 --> 00:16:58.225
{\an8}Magandang kalungkutan, Bunso.

392
00:16:58.308 --> 00:17:01.270
