421
00:18:09.963 --> 00:18:11.840
{\an8}- Ito ay...
- Ano ito?

422
00:18:11.924 --> 00:18:13.050
{\an8}"Methanol."

423
00:18:13.133 --> 00:18:15.719
{\an8}"Ethanol para sa pagdidisimpekta. Methanol."

424
00:18:15.803 --> 00:18:17.221
{\an8}- Ito ay alak.
- Alak?

425
00:18:17.304 --> 00:18:18.263
{\an8}Oo.

426
00:18:19.681 --> 00:18:21.058
{\an8}ISANG KAHON SA ISANG GILID NG LOBBY

427
00:18:21.141 --> 00:18:22.351
{\an8}Naku, ano ito?

428
00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:24.728
Oo, methanol.

429
00:18:24.812 --> 00:18:26.563
MAAARING MANUNA ANG PAGKONSUMO
UPANG LALAMIN ANG PAGLALASON SA ALAK AT KAMATAYAN

430
00:18:26.647 --> 00:18:28.065
